# Embedded libraries — load FIRST. LibStub + CallbackHandler stay (general
# lib plumbing). The minimap launcher retired with Phase C — the ONE suite
# button lives in GloomsHub now (GS icon, opens the Suite window), so LDB +
# LibDBIcon are no longer GB's to load. Fetched into Libs/ by the packager at
# release time; present in the local working copy (not committed).
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua

# Load order: Core (namespace + saved vars + /gb router) first, then the skin
# engine, the shaped proc glows, the per-trigger animation system, the
# bar-layout engine, then the style-editor Config UI (registers the Bars tab).
Core.lua
Skin.lua
Glows.lua
Anims.lua
Layout.lua
Config.lua
